# TPOL: HOME + a sound knob is the motion-lane gesture everywhere (Classic is gone, so the X0X
# SAVE+knob combo is too). With no X0X lane left to clear, the gesture answers "NO MOTION ON ...";
# SAVE + the knob does nothing, and HOME + the knob does not go back.
wait 300
newsong 0
cursor 0 0
tap EDIT
expect view 1
expect part 0
# SAVE + the knob is no longer the gesture
press SAVE
spin K1 20
wait 100
expect msg 0
release SAVE
wait 1500
expect msg 0
# HOME + the knob is the gesture: it says so and stays on the page
press HOME
spin K1 20
wait 100
expect msg 1
release HOME
wait 100
expect view 1
dump motion_knob_home.json
